  "result": "Quiz 0002 is ready: six items on O4, written as `quizzes/0002.json` with its key in `keys/0002.json`. It's titled \"Workflows, agents and who owns the control flow.\"\n\n- **Coverage:** Items q1 and q2 check whether you can tell a workflow from an agent by who decides the next step. Items q3 and q4 ask when a fixed workflow is the better choice and when an agent pays off. Item q5 is a cost calculation, and q6 asks you to correct a teammate's claim in one sentence.\n- **Setting:** Everything is set in the makerspace assistant, with a mix of multiple-choice, numeric and short-answer items.\n- **Check:** I answered each item from its stem alone and each had one defensible answer.\n- **Ahead of the lessons:** There is no lesson on O4 yet, so this quiz checks the objective itself. I wrote it from my own knowledge, not from a source I searched and read.\n- **Misconception ids:** I added M7, M8 and M9 for the new misconceptions and noted them in `NOTES.md`.\n\nDo you want a short lesson on O4 before you take the quiz?",
